# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SQLPulseUI environment configuration
#
# SECURITY: Every value in this file is inlined into the JavaScript
# bundle at build time and is therefore PUBLIC. Never place SQL Server
# credentials, connection strings, or LLM API keys here.
#
# Those secrets belong exclusively to the FastAPI backend. The browser
# reaches SQL Server and the LLM only through the backend's REST API.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Base URL of the SQLPulse backend.
#
# Leave EMPTY to route requests through the Vite dev proxy (recommended
# for local development — avoids CORS entirely). The proxy chooses the
# backend; see BACKEND_TARGET in vite.config.ts.
#
# Set to an absolute URL only when the frontend is served separately from
# the backend. Both backends expose the same REST contract:
#
#   .NET 8 backend   http://127.0.0.1:5266
#   Python backend   http://127.0.0.1:8000
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
